      "text": "Six on the second hand to New Year's resolutions",
      "startTime": null,
      "endTime": null,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
      "kind": "LineInfo",
      "text": "And there's just no question what this man should do",
      "startTime": null,
      "endTime": null,
      "alignment": "Unspecified"
    },
    {
